===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|goh|gisiht}}; from a compound of two Germanic roots:

* The prefix {{m|goh|gi-|pos=commonly used to form nouns}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*ga-}}.

* The noun {{m|goh|siht||sight, vision}}, from {{der|de|gem-pro|*sihtiz}}, akin to {{cog|en|sihþ}}.

Similar developments can be seen in {{cog|nl|gezicht}}, {{cog|ang|ġesihþ}} and {{cog|fy|gesicht}}.

